      "filename": "Harmful Bloom in Lake Atitlán, Guatemala.jpg",
      "title": "File:Harmful Bloom in Lake Atitlán, Guatemala.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/Harmful_Bloom_in_Lake_Atitl%C3%A1n%2C_Guatemala.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
